---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Trust starts with accurate records." description="The controls we are planning, and the limits of this product preview.">
<PageHero eyebrow="The Kora product plan" title="Trust starts with accurate records." lede="The controls we are planning, and the limits of this product preview." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>This site is a preview</h2>
<p>Animated orders, payments and receipts use sample data. There is no connected merchant database, live inventory, bank account or customer messaging automation behind these demos.</p>
<h2>Keep each business separate</h2>
<p>The production design calls for merchant-scoped records, staff permissions and database access rules. Those controls need implementation and testing before real customer records are onboarded.</p>
<h2>Verify before marking paid</h2>
<p>Provider signatures, server-side transaction checks and duplicate-event handling are part of the payment design. Screenshots alone do not establish payment.</p>
<h2>Correct records explicitly</h2>
<p>Stock adjustments need a reason and actor. Refunds and returns are separate actions. There is no universal 24-hour undo for completed transactions.</p>
<h2>Publish the operational details before launch</h2>
<p>Hosting regions, subprocessors, retention periods, backup recovery and support arrangements must be confirmed before the live pilot. This preview makes no certification or regional-hosting claim.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
